{"canonical_quiz_id":"music-people-20261011","mapping_version":"legacy-choice/v1","questions":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-001","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-001-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-001-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-001-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-001-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall называет Арету Франклин первой женщиной, введённой в зал; её индукция состоялась в 1987 году.","source_id":"music-people-001"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-002","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-002-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-002-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-002-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-002-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall указывает Mississippi Goddamn среди записей альбома Nina Simone in Concert, выпущенного в 1964 году.","source_id":"music-people-002"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-003","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-003-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-003-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-003-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-003-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall связывает Bohemian Rhapsody с альбомом A Night at the Opera 1975 года.","source_id":"music-people-003"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-004","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-004-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-004-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-004-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-004-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall называет Keep Yourself Alive первой песней дебютного альбома Queen и отмечает, что её написал Брайан Мэй.","source_id":"music-people-004"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-005","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-005-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-005-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-005-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-005-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall пишет, что в 1973 году Партон завершила семилетнее партнёрство с Портером Вагонером и написала I Will Always Love You как прощальный подарок.","source_id":"music-people-005"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-006","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-006-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-006-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-006-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-006-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Официальная биография Фицджеральд рассказывает, что на Amateur Night она планировала танцевать, но перед выходом решила петь.","source_id":"music-people-006"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-007","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-007-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-007-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-007-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-007-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Официальная биография указывает, что в 1938 году Фицджеральд записала A-Tisket, A-Tasket; запись стала хитом и продержалась в поп-чартах 17 недель.","source_id":"music-people-007"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-008","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-008-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-008-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-008-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-008-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"На странице Rock Hall указано, что Боба Дилана в 1988 году ввёл Брюс Спрингстин.","source_id":"music-people-008"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-009","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-009-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-009-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-009-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-009-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall указывает 1996 год индукции Дэвида Боуи; его представлял Дэвид Бирн.","source_id":"music-people-009"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-010","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-010-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-010-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-010-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-010-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Страница Rock Hall указывает, что Билли Холидей в 2000 году представила Диана Росс.","source_id":"music-people-010"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-011","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-011-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-011-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-011-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-011-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Верный ответ: Изабелла. Официальные источники называют Woodstock-гитару Хендрикса Izabella.","source_id":"music-people-011"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-012","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-012-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-012-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-012-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-012-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Пресс-релиз MoMA называет Biophilia app первым приложением в коллекции музея.","source_id":"music-people-012"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-013","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-013-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-013-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-013-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-013-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Официальные биографии Queen и Freddie Mercury называют его настоящим именем Farrokh Bulsara.","source_id":"music-people-013"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-014","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-014-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-014-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-014-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-014-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"На официальной странице альбома Буш пишет, что хотела представить «Running Up That Hill» как filmic piece of dance.","source_id":"music-people-014"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-015","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-015-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-015-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-015-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-015-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Официальная видеостраница указывает Aardman Animation как production company клипа.","source_id":"music-people-015"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-016","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-016-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-016-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-016-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-016-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"В воспоминании Филипа Гласса на сайте Recording Academy Шанкар назван выдающимся ситаристом; GRAMMY Museum описывает экспозицию его ситаров.","source_id":"music-people-016"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-017","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-017-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-017-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-017-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-017-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"MoMA описывает маленький динамик для подушки во рту Андерсон: через него звучало заранее записанное скрипичное соло, которое она меняла движениями губ.","source_id":"music-people-017"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-018","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-018-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-018-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-018-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-018-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Библиотека Конгресса указывает, что «Respect» была оригинальной композицией Отиса Реддинга 1965 года; Франклин записала свою версию двумя годами позже.","source_id":"music-people-018"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-019","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-019-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-019-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-019-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-019-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Эссе Библиотеки Конгресса называет Вилли Диксона басистом и автором песни, принесённой Мадди Уотерсу в конце 1953 года.","source_id":"music-people-019"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-020","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-020-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-020-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-020-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-020-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"NPS прямо сообщает, что 16 февраля 1923 года Бесси Смит записала «Down Hearted Blues» под фортепиано Кларенса Уильямса.","source_id":"music-people-020"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-021","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-021-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-021-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-021-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-021-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Каталог Rock Hall указывает Sister Rosetta Tharpe как вокалистку Gospel Train; Rock Hall описывает её как новаторскую гитаристку госпела.","source_id":"music-people-021"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-022","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-022-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-022-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-022-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-022-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall называет версию Торнтон оригинальной версией сингла «Hound Dog» 1953 года.","source_id":"music-people-022"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-023","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-023-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-023-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-023-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-023-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall называет Фелу Кути пионером афробита.","source_id":"music-people-023"},{"canonical_id":"music-people-024","options":[{"canonical_id":"music-people-024-opt-1","source_index":0},{"canonical_id":"music-people-024-opt-2","source_index":1},{"canonical_id":"music-people-024-opt-3","source_index":2},{"canonical_id":"music-people-024-opt-4","source_index":3}],"source_explanation":"Rock Hall связывает «I Loves You Porgy» с альбомом Little Girl Blue Нины Симон.","source_id":"music-people-024"}],"source_category":"Музыка","source_description":"Вопросы о певцах, авторах и записях с первичными музейными и официальными источниками.","source_path":"/app/quizzes/MusicPeople/music_people_20261011.json","source_quiz_id":"music-people-20261011","source_sha256":"04c8ce0731c52383b463c8995fecea682f6b5394f478e56b13c5ff67dd4ab486","source_title":"Музыка: голоса и записи"}
